                    "text": "This patch keeps track of the looping state of a groove~ object.\n\nMake sure to connect the right outlet of the groove~ object. @synctype should be set to relative, and  @syncmode should be set to ms or samples.\n\nReturn value: \n2: Loop just started (one sample only)\n1: Playing\n0: Stopped\n-1: Paused"
